    "explanation": "Senator Leahy announces a new $190,000 federal grant to Vermont's Office of the Court Administrator from the U.S. Department of Justice to improve drug court information management. This fits Rule 1 because the senator announces the award of federal funds to a state/local entity. The release also notes Leahy's prior role in helping secure funding and enacting the program, reinforcing credit-claiming.",
