            "2"
        ],
        "document_id": "1809",
        "explanation": "The senator claims credit for the Senate passage of his energy transmission amendment to the energy bill, saying it is a major step for wind energy and that South Dakota will benefit. This is a successful legislative milestone for an amendment he advanced, matching Rule 2. The mention of the Finance Committee voting in favor of tax credits he advanced also supports a legislative victory, but the Senate passage of his amendment is the clearest basis.",
